---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { photographerBioPhoto, heroPhotograph } from '../data/photographs';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<MainLayout
  title={`About Me | ${siteConfig.brandName}`}
  description="Hi, I'm behind photo.pichi.ra. Here is my personal story — from accidentally dropping a camera in a water tank as a kid, to loving photography as my main hobby for the past 1-2 years."
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <!-- Header Hero -->
    <header class="about-hero">
      <div class="container-editorial">
        <span class="about-eyebrow">A Bit of My Story</span>
        <h1 class="about-title">Hey, I'm behind photo.pichi.ra!</h1>
        <p class="about-hero-lead">
          Just someone who genuinely loves cameras, outdoor walks, sunrises, and editing photos in Lightroom.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Visual Feature Frame: Photographer Portrait -->
    <div class="container-editorial">
      <div class="about-feature-image-wrap">
        <Image
          src={photographerBioPhoto.src}
          alt={photographerBioPhoto.alt}
          width={1200}
          height={750}
          format="webp"
          quality={88}
          loading="eager"
          class="about-feature-img"
        />
        <span class="feature-img-caption">Behind the lens &bull; Out in the field with a rented camera</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Narrative -->
    <section class="about-narrative">
      <div class="container-editorial narrative-inner">
        <!-- Section: The Water Tanker Story -->
        <div class="narrative-block">
          <span class="block-tag">Where it all started</span>
          <h2 class="block-title">The camera in the water tanker</h2>
          <div class="block-prose">
            <p>
              My family loves reminding me about this story. My dad always says that even when I was a tiny kid, I was totally obsessed with cameras. I wanted to hold them, press every single button, and look through the viewfinder.
            </p>
            <p>
              One day, my curiosity went a little too far. I was playing around and, by complete mistake, ended up dumping the family camera straight into our water tanker! Obviously, that camera didn't survive, but that childhood spark never really went away.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section: Past 1-2 Years -->
        <div class="narrative-block">
          <span class="block-tag">My Hobby</span>
          <h2 class="block-title">Picking it up seriously for the past 1–2 years</h2>
          <div class="block-prose">
            <p>
              About 1 to 2 years ago, I decided to turn that interest into an active hobby. Whenever work gets busy, heading outdoors with a camera is the one thing that completely clears my head.
            </p>
            <p>
              It makes me wake up at 5:00 AM just to catch the golden light over Alleppey backwaters, or hike through the cool morning mist in Munnar to see tea plantations waking up. It teaches you to sit quietly, watch birds across the water, and pay attention to things you'd normally rush right past.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section: The Gear & Approach -->
        <div class="narrative-block">
          <span class="block-tag">My Setup</span>
          <h2 class="block-title">Why I rent my cameras</h2>
          <div class="block-prose">
            <p>
              I don't own an expensive DSLR or mirrorless camera right now. Instead, whenever I plan a weekend trip, a beach visit, or a nature walk, I take a camera and lenses on rent.
            </p>
            <p>
              At first I thought not owning a camera was a disadvantage, but it has actually been the best way to learn! One weekend I rent a long telephoto zoom lens so I can photograph cranes and ducks without scaring them away. Next time, I rent a fast prime lens to take portraits of friends or capture night lights. It lets me try everything without any pressure.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Callout Quote -->
        <div class="quote-callout">
          <blockquote>
            "You don't need to own the most expensive camera in the world to make photos you love. You just need to wake up early, be patient, and actually look at what's in front of you."
          </blockquote>
        </div>

        <!-- Section: The Digital Darkroom & Practice RAWs -->
        <div class="narrative-block">
          <span class="block-tag">Editing</span>
          <h2 class="block-title">Having fun in Lightroom &amp; Photoshop</h2>
          <div class="block-prose">
            <p>
              Coming home from a shoot and loading up the memory card is my favorite part of the process. I spend hours in Adobe Lightroom and Photoshop, learning how colors work and figuring out my own editing style.
            </p>
            <p>
              I try to keep my edits looking natural — soft morning warmth, deep forest greens, clean water reflections, and gentle shadows. I don't like over-saturated or fake-looking HDR effects; I just want the photo to feel like what it felt like standing there.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Practice RAW Files Credit Box -->
          <div class="practice-raw-callout">
            <div class="callout-badge">
              <span class="badge-dot"></span>
              <span>Learning &amp; Workflow</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="callout-title">Practicing on Free RAW Files</h3>
            <p class="callout-text">
              Testing out my editing workflow on professional RAW practice files! 🎨✨ To learn how to handle tricky lighting, dynamic range, and clean skin tones, I often practice color grading on free RAW files shared by creators online.
            </p>
            <div class="credits-citation">
              <strong>CREDITS:</strong>
              <p>Free RAW practice files provided by <strong>James Reader</strong>:</p>
              <ul class="credits-links-list">
                <li>
                  Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/james.reader" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@james.reader</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                  Website: <a href="https://www.jamesreader.uk/raw-files" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">jamesreader.uk/raw-files</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                  YouTube: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jamesreader" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">youtube.com/jamesreader</a>
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="callout-tags">
                <span>#photoediting</span> <span>#colorgrade</span> <span>#postprocessing</span> <span>#lightroom</span> <span>#creativeediting</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Two-column visual and interest breakdown -->
        <div class="interests-grid">
          <div class="interest-col">
            <div class="interest-img-wrap">
              <Image
                src={heroPhotograph.src}
                alt={heroPhotograph.alt}
                width={800}
                height={600}
                format="webp"
                quality={88}
                loading="lazy"
                class="interest-img"
              />
              <span class="interest-img-caption">{heroPhotograph.title} &bull; {heroPhotograph.location}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="interest-col text-col">
            <span class="block-tag">What I Love Shooting</span>
            <h3 class="interest-heading">My Favorite Things to Capture</h3>
            <ul class="interest-list">
              <li>
                <strong>Landscapes:</strong> Sunrises over backwaters, beach tides, and foggy hill tops in Munnar.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Birds &amp; Wildlife:</strong> Standing still in wetlands waiting for cranes and ducks to do their thing.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Nature:</strong> Sunlight through leaves, rain droplets, textures on rocks, and forest plants.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Creative Edits:</strong> Night shots, candle flames, shadows, and moody color grades.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Portraits:</strong> Genuine, relaxed portraits of friends and editorial lighting tests.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section: Follow the Journey -->
        <div class="narrative-block follow-block">
          <span class="block-tag">Say Hi</span>
          <h2 class="block-title">Follow along on Instagram</h2>
          <div class="block-prose">
            <p>
              I update my Instagram page whenever I go on a new shoot or finish a batch of edits. If you like nature, sunrises, or just following someone's photography hobby, come say hi!
            </p>
            <div class="about-action">
              <a
                href={siteConfig.instagram.url}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="btn btn-primary"
              >
                <span>Check out {siteConfig.instagram.handle} on Instagram</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-top: var(--space-3xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
  }

  .about-hero {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .about-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-olive);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.2vw, 4.2rem);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .about-hero-lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.6vw, 1.35rem);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .about-feature-image-wrap {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .about-feature-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 600px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .feature-img-caption {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .about-narrative {
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .narrative-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .narrative-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .block-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-forest);
  }

  .block-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .block-prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .block-prose p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* Practice RAW Callout */
  .practice-raw-callout {
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-left: 4px solid #E2A03F;
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .callout-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #B57416;
  }

  .badge-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #E2A03F;
  }

  .callout-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .callout-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .credits-citation {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .credits-citation strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .credits-links-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .credits-links-list a {
    color: var(--accent-forest);
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .credits-links-list a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-olive);
  }

  .callout-tags {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  /* Quote Callout */
  .quote-callout {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-xl);
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-olive);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
  }

  .quote-callout blockquote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.2vw, 1.75rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Interests Grid */
  .interests-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .interests-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr;
      padding: var(--space-2xl);
    }
  }

  .interest-img-wrap {
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .interest-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .interest-img-caption {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .text-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .interest-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .interest-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .interest-list li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .interest-list li::before {
    content: '•';
    color: var(--accent-olive);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: -2px;
  }

  .interest-list strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .follow-block {
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .about-action {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }
</style>
